<%= @user.full_name %>,
<p><%= @request.user.full_name %> is requesting access to the following...</p>
<ul>
<% @request.access_requests.each do |access_request| %>
  <li><%= access_request.permission_types.join(', ') %> permissions for <%= access_request.resource.long_name %>.</li>
<% end %>
</ul>
<p>As an owner of one of these resources, please visit <%= @url %> to process the request.</p>

Thanks,
The ACS Team.
